  "reasoning": "The defendant Li used a key obtained from the bank and knowledge of the ATM password to illegally open a self-service bank machine and steal cash amounting to 352,600 yuan. This act involves taking another's property without consent and without use of force, which fits the legal definition of theft (盗窃). The large amount qualifies as a serious theft case, but no other elements (e.g., fraud, robbery, embezzlement) are present. Therefore, the appropriate charge is theft.",
